  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Celebration of National Pollution Control Day</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\nNational Pollution Control Day 2021 is observed annually on December 2.  It is a day to raise awareness about the hazards of air pollution. On the Account of National Pollution Control Day, the NSS wing of ATME College of Engineering organised the plantation of saplings in the college premises.\n\nDr. L Basavaraj, Principal, ATMECE, Dr. M.S Govinde Gowda, Dean Academics, Dr. Bhagyashree S R, Dean Research, and Dr. Sachidanandamurthy K L Administrative Officer were present during the event. The Principal addressed the gathering conveying the importance of Environmental Pollution Control and advised all to have a continuous approach towards this goal.\n\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/report-on-POLLUTION-CONTROL-DAY.pdf\"><strong>REPORT</strong></a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
